<title>SOUTH KOREA: Hansol Telecom plans 1-for-10 rights.</title>
<headline>Hansol Telecom plans 1-for-10 rights.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hansol Telecommunication Co of South Korea plans a one-for-10 rights issue in March, a company statement said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The company planned to issue 168,041 common shares for the rights to shareholders as of March 6.</p>
<p>Further details were not given.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5647</p>
